        "prompt": "=TASK: IMAGE GENERATION\n\nGenerate a flat vector illustration depicting the visual concept described in the sentence: \"{{ $json.output.exampleSentence }}\".\n\n**Style:** Friendly, educational corporate vector art.\n**Visual Elements:** Clean thick outlines, flat pastel colors, simple character designs. Include small floating icons like speech bubbles or sparkles to enhance the scene.\n**Constraint:** If you produce ANY text, digit, letter, numeral, or word inside the image, the output is INVALID. The image must contain only visual depictions \u2014 no typography, no labels, no numbers as numerals, no spelled-out words. For number concepts, show the quantity using grouped objects, dice pips, or finger counts \u2014 never write the number as a digit or word. The output must be the illustration only.",
